description:
Pre-existing gap surfaced by plan-workflow smoke (2026-08-08). NOT
introduced by plan-workflow delivery (ea30b487).

After a smoke crash left the dev server unable to boot, the temp
project's persisted event/projection records had to be cleaned by hand:

    SET eventstore.enable_hard_deletes = 'on';
    SET session_replication_role = 'replica';
    BEGIN;
    DELETE FROM stream_events WHERE stream_id IN (SELECT stream_id FROM streams WHERE stream_uuid IN (...));
    DELETE FROM streams WHERE stream_uuid IN (...);
    COMMIT;

There is no operator-facing `foreman project delete --cascade-events`
path that cleans the event store. Future fix: add an admin command to
delete a project and its stream events atomically, OR document the
manual cleanup recipe in docs/cli-reference.md and docs/user-guide.md.

Tracking bead so the plan-workflow PR doesn't claim cleanup is
operator-friendly when it isn't.
